# TRIFECTA pipeline

- Steps A → B → C; early dropout on Step A (not food / metaphor)
- Structured outputs only (`instructor` + Pydantic) — no free-text frame labels in production
- Era = provenance on records, not separate pipelines or code paths
- Frame verbs are discovery triggers; gold labels frame in context

# Scope

- Keep TRIFECTA logic in this repo — do not add frame annotation code to `hist-text-utils`
- Sibling corpora referenced via manifest keys only

# Outputs

- Semi-structured: `save_semi_structured(..., logical_name=..., script=__file__)`
- Frozen eval sets: `save_parquet(..., logical_name=..., script=__file__)`
- Preserve provenance (`record_id`, `corpus`, `date`, `source_path`) on annotation records
